156	
157	<header class="hero">
158	  <p class="eyebrow">Direction · Trails</p>
159	  <h1>Trails, Reshaped</h1>
160	  <p class="lede">Today a trail is welded to a single change: one branch, at most one PR, in one repo. But the work a trail describes rarely stays that small — a feature lands as changes across several repos, a stack of dependent changes, or an epic with children — and today that intent has no first-class home.</p>
161	  <p>The proposal: the trail moves up to become the <strong>coordination artifact</strong> — one piece of intent spanning many changes. The thing you review and ship today doesn't go away; it becomes the trail's member unit, working title <strong>change request</strong>.</p>
162	  <p class="muted">A proposed direction, for discussion — not yet built. Full detail lives in the design spec; this page is deliberately the high-level shape.</p>
163	</header>
